WEBVTT

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.230
Damn it!

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.710
I wanna talk to whoever's in charge!

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:07.980
I'll give them a piece of my mind!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.240
Oh, my! Whatever is the matter?

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.360
Are you here for conversion? Baptism?

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.950
Or... are you here for me?

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.330
F-For you?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.290
I'm just joking!

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.030
Come now, don't take me seriously!

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.910
Are you all right in the head?

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.000
<i>What do I do now? 
I want to hit her with a fist!</i>

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.110
Our high priest, Zesta-sama, is out 
screwing around while proselytizing...

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.420
That is, he's out spreading the 
glories of Aqua-sama's name.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.090
Wait, what did you just say?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.990
I'm sorry, but you'll have 
to come back another time.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:38.050
Hang on, did a magic user and 
an arch priest come by here?

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.810
Oh, if you're looking for them...

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.540
By the way, the woman you came here with

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.240
is being stoned by children...

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.400
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:55.140
Kazuma...

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:58.950
Even the women and children in 
this town are pretty advanced.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:02.260
Just put away your Eris sect charm already! 
Are you doing this on purpose?

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.080
I refuse!

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.200
I refuse!

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.340
Aqua! Hey, Aqua!

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.850
Welcome, my lost lamb.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.010
Now, tell me of your sins.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:26.830
God will hear them, and will 
surely grant forgiveness.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:42.620
<b>KONOSUBA!
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! 2</b>

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.780
<b>Episode 9  A Goddess for This Corrupt Hot Springs Town!</b>

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:01.320
Listen, it's me! Y'know, me?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.030
Me!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.910
What's with this town? Do something 
about your followers already.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.900
I see. You've performed 
the "It's me" scam, then.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.490
You must think deeply upon your sins.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:18.000
If you do, surely the merciful goddess, 
Aqua-sama, will forgive you.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.310
Why are you trying to stonewall me?!

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.670
I know what this is. 
You're enjoying this, aren't you?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.700
You're tickled that you get to do 
something priestly for once, aren't you?

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.790
Do you have anything else to confess?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.650
If not, then leave here, and live 
a forthright life once again.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:33.710
Damn it, listen!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.150
Aren't you an arch priest, 
which are revered around here?

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.330
If you'd say something to your followers, 
it'd take care of all of this!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.530
Control your people a little!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.450
Nothing else, then?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.040
Well, I must wait for the next lost lamb.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:50.370
Hey!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.730
Now, go forth.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.400
What're you saying?! 
I said get out of there, damn it!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.720
You get out! You're done 
confessing, so get out!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.480
<i>That little...</i>

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:08.350
There is actually something 
I'd like to get off my chest.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.160
Well, please, share it with me!

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.190
Confess now, and admit your sins.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:18.110
Do you have an unhealthy interest 
in a crusader's laundry?

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:22.140
A desire to stick a magic user's 
black hair up your nose?

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:27.400
Inappropriate carnal feelings for 
a beautiful and noble priest?

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:32.640
There's a special cup that a priest 
friend of mine uses for party tricks...

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.290
I accidentally broke it.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:40.410
Also, she was bragging about how she 
had bought some rare, fancy liquor.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:44.340
So I figured, "How good can it be?" 
and poured a little bit for myself...

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:47.390
But it was better than I 
expected, so I drank it all,

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.610
then replaced it with some cheap hooch since 
I figured she couldn't tell the difference.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.930
What are you saying? 
What exactly are you saying, Kazuma?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:56.470
And since the priest in question 
is constantly causing problems,

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:59.810
I posted an opening for an Eris sect priest

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:03.610
on the adventurer guild's help wanted board—

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.220
You apostate!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:09.670
Sheesh, I said I was joking.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:13.430
And you're not really 
looking for another priest?

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:16.700
Putting aside the first two, 
that last one wasn't true at all.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.300
Wait, what was that about the other two?

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.490
Can we... Can we go home, like, soon?

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.260
Please... Please, hear me out.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.740
I have been a member of the Axis faith

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.720
and worshiped Aqua-sama for a long time...

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.520
But!

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.980
The bountiful chest on the 
portrait of the goddess Eris...

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.020
It leads me astray!

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.650
That chest is the chest of a devil!

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:48.580
Please forgive my sinful ways in 
being tempted by another goddess.

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.350
Rest easy.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.510
God forgives all.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.060
Thou shalt love big breasts.

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:59.500
Thou shalt love small breasts.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.200
The Axis faith teaches 
forgiveness in all things.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.340
Whether you're a lolicon, a NEET,

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.800
or a questionably-human 
fan of animal-eared girls...

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.280
As long as you're not interested 
in undead or devil girls,

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.840
you have love in your heart, 
and you don't break the law,

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.810
all will be forgiven.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:22.410
Faithful follower,

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:26.150
I will share holy words that will 
help you avoid demonic temptation.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.950
"Eris pads her chest."

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.740
The next time you feel you are being 
led astray, chant these words.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:37.330
If you know anyone else being tempted, 
you can share it with them.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.020
Eris pads her chest...

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.590
I... I feel as though my eyes have been opened!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.840
Let's say it once more, together.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.220
Eris pads her chest!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.550
Thank you for the wonderful incantation!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.870
Is it okay for a goddess to get along by 
selling out one of her younger co-workers?

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:59.700
Hey, the number and intensity of 
followers is really important for gods!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.060
They directly influence our power.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:05.200
I may not have many followers,

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.650
but their faith is really strong!

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:13.160
I'd do anything for my adoring faithful!

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:14.780
KONOSUBA!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.790
We're back.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.870
Welcome back!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.630
Are you feeling better?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.710
After taking a bath, I felt back to normal.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.410
That's good to hear.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:29.270
With no one else here, it was like 
I had the mixed bath all to myself!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.970
<i>Does that mean...</i>

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:35.050
So, everyone, how did the sightseeing go?

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.600
The Axis cult... scares me.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.620
I-I'm thinking about going 
sightseeing tomorrow, too.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.100
Y-You...

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.450
Well, whatever. Do what you want.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.610
I'm gonna head into the bath.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.700
I'm heading into the bath.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.400
We heard you.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.700
Enjoy yourself.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.080
I'm—

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.310
Get going already!

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.960
What a lovely bath.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.000
Must be nice to be you this morning.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.470
I only came for the baths.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.470
You seem pretty worn out, though.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.980
This place is a demon city...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.860
You've got your hands full, huh?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.460
By the way...

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:37.490
He's been looking right 
at me this whole time...

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:42.330
Excuse me, but being stared at like 
this is kind of embarrassing—

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.500
Don't mind me.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:47.500
R-Right... It's a mixed bath, after all.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.880
Don't mind me.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.570
What a bashful lady!

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:09.100
Damn it, I try to be nice,

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:11.560
and it's conversion this, proselytize that,

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:15.280
and they just don't freaking shut up 
about it for a single second, damn it!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.950
Guess the town's getting to him, too.

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:28.060
This town...

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.340
Better not get mixed up with him.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.840
How's that, sir?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.290
Oh, that's the spot!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.820
This soap is nice and sudsy, right?

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:43.850
Huh, I guess.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:48.730
It can cure any kind of abnormal 
status, and not only that...

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.910
It's actually edible! It only uses 
natural ingredients, so it's sacred!

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.220
You get some if you join the faith!

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.230
And it's free!

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:56.110
No, thanks!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.100
If you join now you, can get 
double points! It's all free!

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:02.740
Don't try to trick me by dressing it up 
with talk of appealing stuff like points!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.240
KONOSUBA!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.620
I wanna go home. I wanna go home already.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:09.420
Hup!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.550
Hey, Megumin! It's rude to swim in the bath!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.340
Come on, don't worry about that.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.020
H-Hey! What are you doing?!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.740
Why are you acting so embarrassed?

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:23.060
We're in a rough line of work.
We can't afford to be so dainty!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.520
Your logic doesn't make sense!

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.090
Oh, my towel!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.320
I was originally just going to drag 
that pair of lazybones outside,

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.030
then hunt the crowds of undead that
Aqua attracts with Kazuma, but...

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.480
That's what you were after?

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:45.370
In any case, what kind of man is he?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.380
He seems conservative 
and cowardly at times,

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.820
but he never lets social standing bother him,

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:52.040
and will get aggressive against nobles...

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.420
You could say he's odd, 
or maybe just strange—

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:55.420
Shh!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.860
Next to us is the mixed bath.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.470
If he had to choose either the 
men's bath or the mixed one,

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:02.970
which do you think he'd choose?

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.310
He might be timid and tend to 
blanch at the crucial moment,

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:09.940
but with the right justification, he wouldn't 
hesitate to enter the mixed bath.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:15.730
Kazuma, you're there, aren't you?

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.860
You're breathing hard with 
your ear against the wall,

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.570
imagining where Darkness 
is going to wash first, right?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.080
M-Megumin, why make me the example?!

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:28.080
Hey, Kazuma! Are you there? 
You are, aren't you?!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.420
I guess he's not there.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.820
Maybe I shouldn't have suspected him...

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.470
I'll just surreptitiously treat 
him to a drink later.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.140
I suppose it actually was rude.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:46.350
He has his faults, but he's 
pretty reliable in the end.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.140
He might not seem like it,

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.730
but he always helps his 
friends when they need it.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.480
He's not earnest about anything, 
but at his core, he's a good person.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:59.490
<i>I'm starting to feel embarrassed 
about eavesdropping...</i>

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:03.400
By the way, Megumin, I was 
curious about how your butt—

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.410
Hold it right there!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:08.640
You may be my friend, Darkness, 
but one more word, and you will pay!

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.500
S-Stop it!

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:14.190
Honestly, what is it with 
these indecent breasts?!

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.380
S-Stop!

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.220
Now!

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.660
See, I knew it!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.250
He was there the whole time, after all!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.020
It makes sense.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:32.760
I feel Kazuma's lusty gaze on me every day.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:36.070
There's no way someone as oversexed 
as him wouldn't be in the mixed bath!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.900
Create Water!

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:41.530
That's cold!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.280
Hey, don't throw the cat!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.540
Wash her in exchange for your eavesdropping!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.340
Must suck for you, having 
such a weird owner, huh?

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.550
KONOSUBA.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.550
This is too much!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:10.010
I just went into the baths!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.770
Y-Your tears really sting when 
they hit me, Aqua-sama...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.520
So how many people did you 
make trouble for today?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.080
What do you mean, trouble?!

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.240
Why do you assume I did something wrong?!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:26.460
It seems, when Aqua-sama went into 
the secret baths at the main church,

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.200
the hot springs changed 
into regular hot water...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.450
And they kicked me out!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:35.890
Why am I getting kicked out by 
the church that worships me?!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:38.130
Tell me why!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.000
<i>Come to think of it, she purified 
the tea into water, too...</i>

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:44.130
But the part that made me maddest 
was when I met the guy in charge...

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.530
I apologize for purifying the 
hot springs into hot water,

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.640
but I couldn't help it.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:56.890
After all, it's because I am the 
goddess of water, Aqua, in the flesh!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.900
I'm a goddess! I'm a goddess, and he did that!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.200
This town's danger is in peril!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.690
What exactly does "danger in peril" mean?

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.710
You were crying all night, and now...

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:21.210
The guy managing the springs told me this...

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:25.460
The quality of the hot springs 
has been dropping a bit lately.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.680
This is probably the Devil 
King's army realizing

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.380
they'd never win a direct 
confrontation with my followers,

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:34.470
so instead, they attack our source 
of income, the hot springs!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.640
Really? Wow, that's something.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.890
Believe me!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:41.510
I admit it's true that most people are 
disgusted by and dislike the Axis cult,

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:43.940
but why bother with such 
an elaborate conspiracy?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.070
I'm going to stand up for this town!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.070
So, you'll all help me, right?

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:55.580
I'm busy with walking around 
town and other stuff.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:59.320
I already know how terrifying 
the Axis cult is,

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:01.330
so I'd rather not get involved.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.250
Why?!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.480
Who cares about your dumb walk?!

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.420
And you don't have to hate my 
followers so much, Megumin!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.300
Wh-What about you, Darkness?

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:14.540
W-Well, I'm... you know...

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.210
Please!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:20.560
Fine! Fine, I'll help! I'll help you, 
so stop purifying my grape juice!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:24.440
Wiz is soft on you, so maybe she'll help?

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:28.440
I was crying to her all night, and in the 
morning, she was fading away again...

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.600
So I let her get some rest.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.070
<i>Come on... Come to me!</i>

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.330
Why don't you save Wiz before the town?!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.280
Come on, come to me!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.740
Sitting here like this, 
the town seems pretty nice.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.310
You're right.

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:52.200
The scenery is nice, and the food is good...

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.090
The only problem is the people.

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:56.480
My, what nice weather!

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:58.850
Is this a blessing from Aqua-sama?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:15:59.980
<i>Here comes one!</i>

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.490
And here's the thing about this pot...

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.960
Nothing burns in it!

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.730
Join the faith now and 
you are guaranteed one!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.120
So, how about it?

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.740
No need to to be shy!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.090
Hmm?

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.710
Wow, out for a stroll?

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:14.810
For you, big brother!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:16.060
For you, little sister!

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:18.740
Join now and you get another, free!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.080
Hey, why won't you look me in the 
eye when I'm talking to you?!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.420
I'm doing this for your sake! 
It's for your own good!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.520
Do you think you could swallow a bar of soap?

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.540
I don't have that much...

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.100
I don't have that much to wash, all right?!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.060
Soap, detergent, soap, 
detergent, soap, detergent...

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.180
Swallow.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.310
Soap, detergent, soap, 
detergent, soap, detergent—

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.440
Swallow.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:48.230
Soap, detergent, soap, 
detergent, soap, detergent,

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:48.690
Swallow.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.120
soap, detergent, soap, 
detergent, soap, detergent,

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:52.700
soap, detergent, soap, 
detergent, soap, detergent!

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.950
I can't swallow this!

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:57.500
It'd make me too clean...

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.960
Kazuma-san!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.360
Wiz? You feeling better?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:10.840
Yes, thank you.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:15.060
For a moment, I saw my party members 
from when I was an adventurer

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:18.850
trying to wave me away from 
the other side of a river,

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.970
but I managed to recover!

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:22.600
<i>Doesn't that mean...</i>

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.320
What were you doing out here?

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.730
Well, actually—

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:30.690
Huh? Wasn't he just...

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:33.730
There was detergent... 
uh, a man there a moment ago.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.730
Oh, my.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:37.970
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.240
That voice...

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.740
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.750
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:46.800
My Axis Church faithful!

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:51.250
The Devil King's army is currently 
plotting sabotage against this town!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.500
...town.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:57.730
As for what exactly they're doing, 
they've put poison in the town's hot springs!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:02.510
Their villainous deeds have already been 
confirmed at a number of hot springs!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.270
...of hot springs.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:08.270
I just was in the hot springs, 
and nothing was wrong.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:12.900
That's because I've been making rounds to 
the hot springs and purifying them all!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:16.280
So she spent her morning doing 
a hot springs tour, huh?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.750
But we can't rest easy yet!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.160
Which is why I'd like to ask for your help!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:25.290
Until this case is solved, 
please don't use the hot springs!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.700
But this is a hot springs city, priest lady!

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:32.300
If you tell people not to go into our 
number one attraction, the hot springs,

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.090
things are gonna dry up around here!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.420
Why would the Devil King's 
army do that, anyway?

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:40.300
Because they intend to cut off the 
Axis Church's source of income!

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:44.730
Yes, the Devil King's army fears 
those of the Axis faith!

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:48.030
It's definitely not because I'm 
trying to stop the rest of you

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:51.430
because it's unfair that only 
I don't get to use the baths!

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.790
Now, Axis faithful—

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.570
There she is!

00:18:55.880 --> 00:19:00.280
That's the pain-in-the-butt woman who's been 
turning all the hot springs into hot water!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.160
Wait—

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.890
Catch her, everyone!

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.540
Tie her up! Let's tie her up!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.530
I thought it sounded fishy!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.060
You were trying to trick us, eh?!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.400
Is this some new kind of scam?

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.720
What are you really after?!

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:13.670
We work so hard to try and 
make the world a better place!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.380
This is a wild change of events.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.800
I-It's not like that!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.510
There's a good reason for all this!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:21.140
I think Aqua-sama is about to start crying!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.160
Everyone, calm down! Just listen to me!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.430
Hey, Darkness, don't just 
sit there! Say something!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.370
Just like we rehearsed!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:32.610
You're supposed to beg the 
Axis Church for its help!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:35.580
Say it! Quit being shy, and just do it!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:39.780
P-Please help, Axis Church...

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.030
We can't hear you, blonde lady!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:43.410
Poor thing.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.910
Oh, fine! Then I'll reveal my identity!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.910
Honored followers of the Axis faith,

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.040
my name is Aqua.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.500
Yes, I am the one you worship,

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.960
Aqua, the goddess of water!

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:04.120
I have come here personally to help you all!

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:11.270
Quit screwing around!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.050
If you think you can pretend to be Aqua-sama

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:16.070
because you have blue hair 
and eyes, you'll be cursed!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.690
We still oughta tie her up! 
Tie her up and toss her in the lake!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:23.820
If she's really the goddess of water, 
Aqua-sama, she'd be fine in a lake!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.080
Liar!

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:29.600
I bet you're actually a servant 
of the Devil King's army

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.580
here to bankrupt our hot 
spring city, aren't you?!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:38.340
It's true! I'm actually a goddess!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.380
But I'm the goddess of this town...

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.970
They're so mean!

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:50.830
Why did I get stoned by my own followers?!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:54.920
Aqua-sama, p-please drink this and calm down.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.890
Otherwise, your agitated holy aura 
is going to hit me, and I'll...

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.490
I want booze.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.990
You're not really that upset, are you?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.410
I understand you're desperate,

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.740
but calling yourself a god is a bit much.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:15.000
But if they go into polluted 
water, they'll get sick...

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:19.380
Why are you trying to help them
after what they put you through?

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:24.130
But if I don't do anything, 
my dear followers will...

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:30.160
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:33.860
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:37.160
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.170
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.900
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:48.480
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:46.850
What is this?!

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:47.820
What's going on?

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:51.040
Have my adoring faithful decided 
to believe me and drop by?

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:52.060
Slay the demons! Defeat the Devil King!

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.200
There she is!

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.540
The witch who claims the name of a goddess!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Time for a witch hunt!

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:40.270
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:40.270
<b>God's Blessing on This Wonderful Party!</b>

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:40.390
<b>My dear friends Funifura-san and Dodonko-san. Please don't come to visit!
I know you said you're two days away from Axel, but please turn back right away! 
I assure you, I am not just pretending. Right now, the town is suffering from 
unprecedented storms and earthquakes as the Devil King's generals
are waging a siege; things are very dangerous. And is there something 
you enjoy about cornering someone?! Well?! Is there?!
-Yunyun</b>

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:34.320
My dear friends Funifura-san and Dodonko-san.

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:36.140
Please don't come to visit!

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.920
I know you said you're 
two days away from Axel,

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:40.270
but please head back—
